<title>USA: WLR Foods sets stock payout in lieu of cash.</title>
<headline>WLR Foods sets stock payout in lieu of cash.</headline>
<dateline>BROADWAY, Va. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>WLR Foods Inc said Thursday it declared a stock dividend in lieu of the regular cash dividend, to be paid with 0.00525 shares for each share of common stock outstanding on the record date.</p>
<p>The estimated value of the stock dividend will be equivalent in value to a $0.06 per share cash dividend, the company said.  WLR had paid a regular quarterly dividend of $0.06 per share, most recently in February.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be distributed on May 2, 1997 to its shareholders of record as of April 11, 1997.</p>
